    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1RA_1LC1RB_0LD1LD_0RA0LC [SCycL 2 0; SWin 2; SCycR 2; SWin 4; SWinR 1] (StD, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
