Module LAPT_1RB1RA_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_1RA0LC.
(** * LAPT_1RB1RA_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_1RA0LC: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB1RA_1LC1RB_0RA1LD_1RA0LC, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

    Auto-emitted by tools/counters/emit_lapcert.py (UNTRUSTED emitter; the Coq
