    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StA, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1RA_1LC1RD_0RB0LC_1RA1LD [SWinR 2; SCycL 3 0; SWin 2; SCycR 3; SWin 2] (StA, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
