  - intros t Ht p _. apply fire_1RB1RA_1RC0LA_1LD0LA_0RB0LD. exact Ht.
Qed.

Theorem nqhtr_1RB1RA_1RC0LA_1LD0LA_0RB0LD : NeverQuasiHaltsTr tm_1RB1RA_1RC0LA_1LD0LA_0RB0LD.
