Proof.
  intros v i q0 E. destruct (Alph_000_001_00.cview_some_Alph_000_001_00 v i q0 E) as (_ & H2).
  unfold Cin_1RB1RA_1RC1LA_1LD1RA_0RC0LD, cden, AI1_1RB1RA_1RC1LA_1LD1RA_0RC0LD; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
